  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1270179/description_057f8b4d-3379-4f80-b527-f7ff4776da53.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;歡迎來到 Egorsans 的 Boss 模組！</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;本模組將新增三個以上的 Boss！</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;若要獲取模組更新資訊，請加入我的 Discord 伺服器</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/FgyGj3k9Zn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/FgyGj3k9Zn</a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a40bb446-405a-45f5-9c5e-27a5f447bc59.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"524\" height=\"524\"></p>\n<p>也請支持我的 Patreon！ <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/EgorSans1337\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.patreon.com/c/EgorSans1337</a></p>\n<p>此模組需要 Geckolib！  &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1270179/description_97b91c93-5f1c-456f-ae11-79bb624aff42.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"443\" height=\"219\"></p>\n<p>常見問題 (FAQ)</p>\n<p>問：這個模組會移植到 Fabric 嗎？<br>答：不會，我不太喜歡 Fabric。</p>\n<p>問：我可以將此模組放入整合包中嗎？<br>答：當然可以！請隨意使用。</p>\n<p>問：這個模組會移植到其他新版或舊版嗎？<br>答：不會，僅支援 1.20.1。</p>\n<p>問：我可以展示或介紹這個模組嗎？<br>答：當然可以！</p>\n<p>協助者名單</p>\n<p>medovibee<br><br>我推薦你觀看這些影片！